# Old generated SSR bundles (the .tsx next to them is the tracked source).
# "check:ssr-tv" now compiles _ssr_tv_check.tsx into .tmp-ssr-tv/ on every run
# (scripts/check-ssr-tv.mjs); stale local copies of these bundles stay ignored.
**/_ssr_tv_check.cjs
**/_ssr_tv_check.mjs

